          "id": 1189378847,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Hello, Alexis.\nOf course, here is `Error message` received as an answer on `Startup message`.\n\n[pgsql_error_on_startup.pcapng](/uploads/588731f988b1955e05f1dab3c25d5aa0/pgsql_error_on_startup.pcapng)\n\nI have simplest postgresql configuration: enabled ssl and denied tcp connections without ssl.\n\nfor example: when we have message `\"E\" \"\\x0\\x0\\x0\\x4e\" \"SFATAL\\0\" \"C28000\\0\" \"Mtext\\0\" \"\\0x\"` the rest of the length var will be equal to 3 = the number of parameters",
